From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PixelOS PIF <pif@localhost>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] key attestation: limit defaults and refresh patch levels

Keep the default policy scoped to GMS and Play Store as documented. The
inherited target list also rewrote system and third-party attestations and
forced software key generation for a financial application.

Refresh patch-level settings on reads with the same five-second window as
keybox data, preserving the previous snapshot on provider errors. Settings
updates otherwise remain invisible until the requesting process restarts.
Use elapsed time for target refreshes so wall-clock adjustments cannot stall
policy updates.

---
diff --git a/core/java/android/security/trickystore/TrickyStoreService.java b/core/java/android/security/trickystore/TrickyStoreService.java
--- a/core/java/android/security/trickystore/TrickyStoreService.java
+++ b/core/java/android/security/trickystore/TrickyStoreService.java
@@ -51,28 +51,12 @@
     }

