-     * TrickyStore target list closely enough that Play Integrity works out of the box,
-     * while leaving every unrelated application with its genuine hardware attestation.
+     * Default to the two PIF packages. Other callers retain their native keys and
+     * attestations unless the user explicitly configures a target policy.
      */
     public static final String DEFAULT_TARGET_LIST = String.join("\n",
-            "android",
             "com.android.vending",
-            "com.google.android.gsf",
